{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01522","headline":"琴曲歌辞 霹雳引 · 沈佺期","name":"琴曲歌辞 霹雳引","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岁七月，火伏而金生。\n客有鼓瑟於门者，奏霹雳之商声。\n始戛羽以騞砉，终扣宫而砰駖。\n电耀耀兮龙跃，雷阗阗兮雨冥。\n气呜唅以会雅，态歘翕以横生。\n有如驱千旗，制五兵，截荒虺，斮长鲸。\n孰与广陵比，意别鹤俦精而已。\n俾我雄子魄动，毅夫发立，怀恩不浅，武义双辑，视胡若芥，翦羯如拾。\n岂徒慨慷中筵，备羣娱之翕习哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01522.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01522","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}